/S /P
/ActualText (This group of traders engages in significant volumes on traditional financial instruments such as stocks, futures, derivatives, and forex, but has not yet taken the step into cryptocurrencies. These traders generally have larger capital than what is invested in cryptos and follow well-established investment behavior patterns, making them a key target for YASUKE.)
