>>
endobj
330 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (However, the question remains: why have these traders not yet integrated cryptocurrencies into their portfolios? According to a survey conducted among 10,000 active traders, 75% were identified as active traders in traditional financial products. Here are the main barriers they mentioned :)
