350 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (In 2022, the cryptocurrency industry faced several major scandals, profoundly impacting the public perception of digital assets. The bankruptcies of significant exchanges exposed security flaws and highlighted the lack of rigorous regulatory frameworks.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
351 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (For active traders in traditional financial products, security and regulation are essential criteria for adopting a cryptocurrency exchange platform. Accustomed to dealing with regulated and reliable intermediaries, they demand similar security standards in the crypto space. According to a survey, 38% of traders identified the lack of regulatory framework and security as the main obstacle to their participation in the crypto market.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
