/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Without a secure and regulated environment, active traders will remain cautious and will allocate only a small portion of their capital to digital assets. To bridge this gap, it is crucial to offer a platform that complies with the strictest regulatory standards, with complete transparency regarding the management of users' funds and protection of their assets.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
