592 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Cryptocurrencies, including the tokens offered on the YASUKE platform, are not considered financial instruments within the meaning of Article L.211-1 of the Monetary and Financial Code. Consequently, they do not benefit from the protections afforded to traditional financial products under this regulation, and their acquisition involves substantial risks.)
/Pg 45 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
