<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Cryptocurrencies are extremely volatile and can experience significant price fluctuations over short periods. Investors should be aware that the value of digital assets can increase or decrease rapidly, resulting in partial or total loss of the investment.)
/Pg 45 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
595 0 obj
<<
