<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Cryptocurrencies are subject to varying regulations depending on the jurisdiction, and these regulations can evolve rapidly. Users must ensure that they comply with all local laws and are aware of legislative changes that could affect their cryptocurrency transactions.)
/Pg 45 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
